      "claim": "Propranolol food effect increased F from 0.27 to 0.46, indicating that the fed state can raise oral bioavailability for high-first-pass drugs, relevant to the fed query.",
      "card_ids": ["C37"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Multiple human beta-blocker contexts (propranolol 27.2%, bevantolol 57%, diacetolol 30-42%, l-propranolol 40.7%, penbutolol 90%) all show F >= 20%, reinforcing that the training gold outcomes are predominantly high.",
      "card_ids": ["C05", "C10", "C01", "C08", "C03"]
